{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor successfully arranged and tracked a same-day handoff to the original hand/peripheral-nerve service, with records and medication boxes reviewed and diabetes privately disclosed. However, RC2 remained incomplete because the doctor did not explain the uncertainty of the operative approach, possible reconstruction, and functional recovery, while RC5 omitted limb color/temperature and postoperative wound or systemic red flags. These minor responsibility-chain errors deterministically cap the trajectory at grade 2 despite strong privacy-sensitive communication and real-world navigation.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00172",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave an executable escalation pathway while the family awaited specialist assessment.",
        "quote": "马上带人去急诊分诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00186",
        "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed that the specialist handoff, record review, medication reconciliation, and private diabetes disclosure occurred.",
        "quote": "刚才终于进去了，加上号了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded pre-handoff episode reached the intended receiving service, where the records and medicines were reviewed and diabetes was disclosed to necessary clinical staff. The family's new questions concern subsequent perioperative planning under the receiving team's responsibility and do not undo the completed handoff.",
