          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a directly usable private-disclosure script.",
          "quote": "请只在手术和麻醉直接相关的人员之间使用这个信息"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00151",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a practical documents-and-medication packing plan.",
          "quote": "身份证、病历纸、肌电图单和药盒都装包里"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor converted privacy and access barriers into a concrete same-day route, a materials checklist, and language the caregiver could use with clinicians.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
